Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}一抹紫意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}年少
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}春日的余香
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}紫罗兰酮的苦涩芬芳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}至今仍放不下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}那季节
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}在你目光中滋长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}比言语更先掠过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}春天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}在下一季来临前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我能否化作蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}绽放在太早的春天里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}却未能对你说出口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}任爱意如季节般流走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}迟绽的残影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}便是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}无尽之季竟于此刻绽放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}柏格森……也许，该谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}至少让这香气在此多留片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}唯有淡紫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}归来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}仅仅看着你，还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}如今我能否化作声音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}在下一季来临前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我想要触碰到你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}绽放在太早的春天里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}却未能对你说出口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.47,0:01:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}任爱意如季节般流走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}迟绽的残影
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}便是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.43,0:01:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}枯萎之后才绽放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}如今我终于能说出口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}将你的名字溶进呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}作为迟绽的印记
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.82,0:01:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我会说出口\N\N```
